WEBVTT

00:06:59.347 --> 00:07:04.402
I appointed some of Sierra Leone's
brightest young people as leaders,

00:07:05.457 --> 00:07:09.101
with responsibility to realize
our shared vision

00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:10.837
of transforming Sierra Leone.

00:07:11.907 --> 00:07:15.167
I am grateful many of them said yes.

00:07:16.404 --> 00:07:18.646
Let me give you a few examples.

00:07:19.496 --> 00:07:23.055
Corruption had been endemic
in governance, institutions

00:07:23.079 --> 00:07:25.379
and in public life in Sierra Leone,

00:07:25.403 --> 00:07:27.631
undermining public trust

00:07:27.655 --> 00:07:30.217
and the country's
international reputation.